OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after boys found inside
OL,4,Aformer Debenhams
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo boys have been arrested after they
OL,7,Fwere found inside the former Debenhams
OL,8,Fbuilding in Nottingham city centre.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said a closure
OL,11,Forder issued by magistrates in December
OL,12,F2025 following "repeated incidents of
OL,13,Fanti-social behaviour" had been
OL,14,Fextended several times.
OL,16,FThe force said it received a report on
OL,17,FMonday that youths had accessed the
OL,18,Froof of the building in Long Row, off
OL,19,FOld Market Square.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
