OL,3,GNEWSAArrests after boys found inside
OL,4,Aformer Debenhams
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers attended the scene and
OL,7,Farrested two boys,13 and 15, on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of entering a closed premises
OL,9,Fin breach of a closure order. They were
OL,10,Freleased on bail while inquiries
OL,11,Fcontinue.
